    - Storage qualification -> proposal "HDR storage and camera response", "Storage inventory
      and open qualification", "Finite-angular solar specular response" and fresh receipts;
      camera/shared-display/postprocessing ownership
      contracts -> bounded-storage, calibration-safety, postprocess and OIT diagnostics.
    - Completion -> all preceding contracts -> second review and independent completion audit;
      unresolved storage decisions prevent acceptance. These mappings describe investigation
      evidence and do not claim future runtime conversion or integrated validation.

